        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-review-next-steps-376a8f67-5d1b-485d-b690-f2544328b23b",
        "text": "You've done an amazing job! Remember how we first used *HTML* to build the structure of our \"All About Owls\" page, like the framework of a house?",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/9f4531d1f6f1f537fe5ace1f8a8541b4-intro-unit1-lesson2-review-next-steps-panel-1-0a0c30e0-71d3-4219-b96f-681c447f8032.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-review-next-steps-736d632f-5318-4a83-8c8f-c7da3d01b2ed",
        "text": "Then, you brought it to life with *CSS*! You added colors, arranged sections, and styled text, transforming the basic layout into a vibrant and engaging page, just like an interior designer furnishing a home.",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/3155f308ad9ea4cc0aff94292278d42f-intro-unit1-lesson2-review-next-steps-panel-2-ebe3bc2d-f21a-477f-9f30-cb60235e657e.png",
        "layout": "text-top-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-review-next-steps-714a7764-e2ff-4913-9b1c-46f5b0061449",
        "text": "Together, HTML gave your page its content and organization, and CSS made it beautiful and easy to read. You created a complete and stylish webpage from scratch!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/a349fa153b0e322f6b9179f411cab64e-intro-unit1-lesson2-review-next-steps-panel-3-c3615b8e-a9dd-4f00-b213-a4ddb61202ca.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
      },
      {
        "key": "intro-unit1-lesson2-review-next-steps-13a945ce-f94d-49f9-891b-4210afb04466",
        "text": "What other elements could you add? How might you change the colors or fonts to create an entirely new look? The possibilities are endless!",
        "imageUrl": "https://images.code.org/b08b15aa7bf383ca056caef105528a2d-intro-unit1-lesson2-review-next-steps-panel-4-db877f12-20e5-4b0c-a04f-dd4e81563ec4.png",
        "layout": "text-bottom-center"
